  "observations": [
    "C105 and R107 now sit below U101, with separate short front dVdT and ILIM tracks.",
    "Local front ground copper joins the exposed pad, GND pin and the two passive returns; two conventional vias connect it to In1.",
    "In1 reference copper is continuous beneath the two control traces and remains separated from the neighboring AUX reference region.",
    "The PG/SHDN escape remains clear of the new control tracks; the neighboring AUX ground regions and back feedback routes remain intact.",
